
├── frontend/             → The React + Vite web application.
│   ├── src/api/          → API client (fetches data from the FastAPI backend).
│   ├── src/components/   → Reusable React UI components.
│   ├── src/pages/        → High-level page views (Dashboard, Research, Settings).
│   └── src/store/        → Zustand state management.
├── src/researchhq/       → The core Python backend and pipeline.
│   ├── cli.py            → Command-line interface entry points.
│   ├── config.py         → Environment and yaml configuration loading.
│   ├── db/               → SQLite database interactions (history storage).
│   ├── gui/              → The PySide6 Desktop application code.
│   ├── tui/              → The Textual terminal application code.
│   ├── server/           → The FastAPI application (serves the React frontend).
│   ├── llm/              → Code to interact with LLMs (Groq, OpenAI, Ollama).
│   ├── pipeline.py       → Orchestrator that strings agents together.
│   ├── agents/           → Individual agent logic (planner, searcher, synthesizer, etc).
│   └── reports/          → Markdown/HTML/JSON report generation and export.
├── install.py / .sh      → Installation scripts for users.
├── pyproject.toml        → Python dependencies and build configuration.
└── config.yaml           → Default configuration template.
